00:03:45,768 --> 00:03:49,874
The call If your bench has a hinged
storage seat, this is the decision you
have

54
00:03:49,874 --> 00:03:53,981
been dodging: the box under the lid is
full and you cannot say what is in it.

55
00:03:53,981 --> 00:03:58,087
Storage under a seat you sit on ten times
a day is storage you will never open,

56
00:03:58,087 --> 00:04:02,194
because opening it means clearing the seat
first.

57
00:04:02,194 --> 00:04:06,300
Live with it for a week and count honestly
how many times you lift that lid.

58
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:10,406
Fewer than three and the answer is
settled.

59
00:04:10,406 --> 00:04:14,513
Empty it completely and refill it only
with things used while sitting, spare
laces,

60
00:04:14,513 --> 00:04:18,619
a shoe horn, a rag for wiping soles.

61
00:04:18,619 --> 00:04:22,726
Everything else moves somewhere you can
reach without asking a person to stand up.

62
00:04:22,726 --> 00:04:26,832
If it is still empty in a month, leave it
empty.

